@*
    The dashboard document shell (R28). Blazor static SSR renders this on every request — no
    interactivity, no SignalR circuit, matching the server's stateless model. The theme is inlined
    from Dash.Css so there's no wwwroot / static-web-assets pipeline to ship, and there is no
    blazor.web.js: navigation and forms are plain HTML (full server re-render), keeping it
    dependency-free and robust under single-file packaging.
*@
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>cifail dashboard</title>
    <style>@((MarkupString)Dash.Css)</style>
</head>
<body>
    <Routes />
</body>
</html>
